sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Web as Angular studio
  participant API as NestJS API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Worker as Renderer worker
  participant Tools as Local media tools

  User->>Web: Queue render
  Web->>API: POST render job
  API->>DB: Persist job and audit row
  Worker->>API: Claim queued job
  API->>DB: Create attempt and mark running
  Worker->>Tools: Generate/compose media
  Worker->>API: Heartbeat and structured logs
  Worker->>API: Persist asset manifest
  API->>DB: Store checksum, logs, status
  Web->>API: Load generated asset for review

